{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50117","headline":"游仙窟诗 别十娘 · 张文成","name":"游仙窟诗 别十娘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽然闻道别，愁来不自禁。\n眼下千行泪，肠悬一寸心。\n两劒俄分匣，双凫忽异林。\n殷懃惜玉体，勿使外人侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文成","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}